        "original_id": "11b6e36e-6169-52bf-bdc2-5a495d223a9a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2015 FA Community Shield, 2014–15 Premier League\n- Organizations: Arsenal, Chelsea, FA Community Shield, Premier League, FA Cup, McDonald's\n\nFacts:\n- The fixtures for the 2014–15 Premier League were announced on 18 June 2014.\n- The 2015 FA Community Shield was the 93rd FA Community Shield, an annual English football match between the previous season's Premier League winners and FA Cup winners.\n- The 2015 FA Community Shield was also known as the 2015 FA Community Shield supported by McDonald's for sponsorship reasons.\n- Arsenal contested the 2015 FA Community Shield as the 2014–15 FA Cup winners.\n- Chelsea contested the 2015 FA Community Shield as the champions of the 2014–15 Premier League.",
